From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bryan Hoban <bryan.hoban@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 14:14:40 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Dolby Vision: add the tools/dvbridge library

tools/dvbridge builds a small static C library, dvbridge_core, that the
Dolby Vision side of Kodi links:

- dvbridge_core and dvbridge_metadata.h: the Dolby Vision transport
  metadata serializer for graphics-only frames (the menu output: one
  synthetic L1 block and the full-raster L5), whose state is committed
  only after the frame was presented;
- dvbridge_gl_pack and pack_gles300.*: the OpenGL ES packer that puts
  the menu's GUI into the tunnel's pixel layout;
- dvbridge_fel*: Profile 7 FEL decoding. The enhancement layer is split
  from the stream, hardware-decoded by a second FFmpeg decoder and
  paired with the base layer by presentation time, using FFmpeg's HEVC
  parser (bounded lookahead, no nearest-picture substitution);
  dvbridge_fel_seek.h finds a base-layer entry point before a
  recoverable enhancement-layer anchor after a seek; a failed pairing
  records why (dvbridge_fel_error) for the decoder's resynchronisation.

Video reconstruction is not here: it is the Vulkan engine's
(yblod-engine/vk). Nothing builds the library until kodi-9957 adds it
to the build.

Licence: tools/dvbridge is GPL-3.0-or-later. LICENSES/README.md says so
for the ENABLE_DVBRIDGE build, which is therefore distributed under
GPL-3.0-or-later while existing files keep their notices, and
LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later holds the licence text in Kodi's licence-file
format. PROVENANCE.json records how dvbridge_metadata.h derives from
intel-dv-linux's reviewed mpv adapter; it is a derivation record, not a
third-party provenance clearance.

Formerly the tools/dvbridge and LICENSES parts of kodi-9990-native-dv,
kodi-9993-fel-presentation-pairing, yblod-01, -02, -03, -29, -30, -50
(FEL fault reasons), -55 and -56. What yblod-30, -55 and -56 removed as
unused (the libplacebo, VPP and dma-buf paths, video packing, the film
metadata levels, mpv_dvbridge_cm4.h; checked with git grep over the
whole tree) is not added.
